BEGIN:VCARD
VERSION:3.0
PRODID:-//Emergency Contacts India//EN
N:All India;Emergency 112;;;
FN:Emergency 112 - All India (ERSS)
ORG:Government of India
TEL;TYPE=CELL,VOICE:112
NOTE:Unified 24x7 nationwide emergency response for Police, Fire, and Ambulance. Works without unlocking phone or active SIM.
CATEGORIES:Emergency
END:VCARD

